    "Setup: Player 1 controls GD03-023 in slot1 and two (AGE System) units in slot2/slot3 (GD03-019, GD03-031). Player 2 has a normal defender in slot1 and an active blocker (GD03-003) in slot2.",
    "Action (manual): Player 1 plays GD02-103 from hand during MAIN_PHASE.",
    "Expect: GD02-103 main effect places 1 EX Resource (energy_extra) because Player 1 has an (AGE System) unit in play.",
    "Expect: TRIGGER_EX_RESOURCE_PLACED resolves and GD03-023 enqueues TARGET_CHOICE for exactly one friendly (AGE System) unit.",
    "Action (manual): Resolve TARGET_CHOICE and select GD03-031_unit_0001 (or GD03-019_unit_0001).",
    "Expect: Selected unit gains High-Maneuver until end of turn (KEYWORD_GRANTED notification, duration=UNTIL_END_OF_TURN).",
    "Action (manual): Advance to ATTACK_PHASE and declare attackUnit with the selected unit targeting playerId_2 slot1 defender.",
    "Expect: Because attacker has High-Maneuver, BLOCKER_CHOICE is not enqueued and playerId_2 cannot block with GD03-003."
  ],
